<title>UK: TABLE-South West Water year pretax up 22 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-South West Water year pretax up 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		92.1		   vs 77.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 24.9		   vs 20.7</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 36.7		   vs 30.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     132.6		  vs 109.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   343.6		  vs 314.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 118.0 and 140.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Above pretax results include bid response costs of 5.2 million stg in 1997 and 700,000 stg in 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name - South West Water Plc. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
